text We finally manage to slip out of the crowd of the school building.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM40"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM40.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Bear]
text ...
text Tomoyo gives a few hard tugs on the edge of my shirt.
text @[Tomoya]
text What's wrong?
text She points at the refreshment booth right next to us.
text It's selling ice cream.
text @[Tomoya]
text You want to eat ice cream?
text She nods deeply.
text @[Tomoya]
text You want to eat some together?
text *Nod*
text @[Bear]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Am I buying?
text *Nod*
text @[Tomoya]
text Why, you... Man, it's a pretty nasty situation to be in, having to buy ice cream for both myself and a bear...
text @[Bear]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, I get it. Don't look at me with those enthusiastic eyes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, I'd like two ice creams, please.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I say this to the person tending the shop.
sound 7W1.aac
text @[Store Employee]
text We have chocolate, vanilla, strawberry, and melon. Which one would you like?
text @[Tomoya]
text She asks.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM40"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM40.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Bear]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Vanilla?
text She shakes her head.
text @[Tomoya]
text Chocolate?
text *Shake* *Shake*
text @[Tomoya]
text Come on, just say it!
text @[Bear]
text ...
text The bear comes close and embraces me.
sound 7W2.aac
text @[Bear]
text ...Strawberry, of course!
text @[Tomoya]
text What's this "of course"? It's the first I've heard of it!
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I distance myself from the bear and face the shop attendant once more.
text @[Tomoya]
text Vanilla and strawberry.
sound 7W3.aac
text @[Store Employee]
text That makes 200 yen for the both of them.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's pretty expensive...
text I exchange a bill for the ice creams.
text @[Tomoya]
text Here you go.
text I give one of them to Tomoyo.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well...?
text @[Tomoya]
text How do you plan on eating this?
text @[Bear]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text That mouth doesn't open, does it?
text Seeming troubled, she looks at her surroundings.
text Then, she grabs my arm and starts running off with me.
bgload KURO.jpg 88
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 88
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text When we get under the shade of a tree, she finally takes off the costume.
text Sweat is dripping from her forehead like a waterfall.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM25"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM25.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7W4.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...Haah... haah...
text She's breathing heavily.
text @[Tomoya]
text You sure look like you're having an incredible amount of fun.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM16"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM16.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7W5.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Of course I am.
sound 7W6.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text After all is said and done, this IS a festival, after all...
text @[Tomoya]
text It looks to me like you're just forcing yourself to have fun, though...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM18"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM18.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7W7.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Of course I'm not forcing myself...!
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, you look restless...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM33"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM33.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7W8.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yes... Maybe I am...
sound 7W9.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I mean... I've never been to this kind of thing without looking out of place.
text I think you've been looking plenty out of place already, though...
music ~
sound 7WA.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Not to mention... I'm not alone here this time...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Tomoyo's hot red face turns toward me.
music BGM08D.mp3
text I've always been happy with Tomoyo's honest confessions to me.
text I'd say that a normal person would be so embarrassed, they'd really hesitate to do so.
text Not even bothered by our ice cream melting, we kiss under the tree.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM22"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM22.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7WB.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It really is hot, isn't it?
text @[Tomoya]
text You're the only one who's hot. I feel cool right now.
sound 7WC.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text You're quite the calm one, aren't you Tomoya?
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, not really...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I shift my gaze to the bustling crowd of people.
text Within it is a single small child.
text He bumps into the legs of the students walking around, looking at many points as if he's about to fall down.
text @[Tomoya]
text Look.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM22"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM22.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7WD.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Mhm.
text Tomoyo sees it too.
sound 7WE.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I'll go for a bit.
text @[Tomoya]
text True student council president material.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM16"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM16.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7WF.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yes... Really, what a hopeless child.
text I wonder if she likes children.
text Almost as if taking this opportunity as a nice excuse, I puff out my chest for her.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll come too.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM22"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM22.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 7WG.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text No, the ice cream'll melt if you do. Please wait here.
text @[Tomoya]
text Really?
sound 7WH.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yes. I'll be right back.
text Believing in her words, I decide to wait.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Her long hair fluttering in the wind, she gallantly goes running over.
text She crouches down and talks to the child.
text She protects him with both arms as she does, so he won't get kicked by students passing through.
text And the child smiles back at her.
text I guess even a child that young can feel how uplifting it is to have Tomoyo so close to you.
text At the very least, I can guarantee that with her around, being in this school will be safer than any other place out there.
text Tomoyo embraces the child. She then holds him by the backside and lifts him up.
text She starts running around, weaving her way through the surging crowd.
text I bet she's looking for his parents.
music ~
text However, after a few steps, her run comes to a halt.
text Tomoyo stands stock still.
music BGM01.mp3
text At the end of my gaze... Several male students are weaving through the crowd in a similar way, and start approaching Tomoyo.
text From that, I can vaguely imagine what this is about.
text The bear costume lying at my feet.
text It's about why she'd been wearing that up until now.
text Even when Tomoyo ran up to the child, she ought to have been wearing this.
text If she did, she might have not been caught...
text ...by the people from the student council.
text From their exchange afterward, I can hazard a guess as to what this is all about, although I can't hear what they're saying.
text She's probably saying, "I'm making sure this child is taken to his parents."
text And in return, the student council is probably saying, "Then we'll make sure that is indeed all you do."
text When it ends, Tomoyo comes running up to me.
text She makes sure to smile for me, even as sweat is causing her hair to stick to her forehead.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I wonder why she's able to smile like that.
text I wasn't able to figure it out.
text Because she was causing so much trouble for the people close to her.
text Betraying all their expectations, only for the likes of me.
text In my hand...
music ~
text the ice cream continues to melt.
